<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Omnium Folio <%= day.date %></title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#e8c66b">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="omniumfoliosnitch">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="Omnium Folio, missing progress <%= day.date %>">
<meta property="og:description" content="<%= day.missingCount %> of <%= day.total %> Finnish mythic raiders have not finished their Omnium Folio.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://marantle.github.io/omniumfoliosnitch/<%= day.date %>.html">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary">
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    background: #14161a;
    color: #d6d9de;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5em 1em 3em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5em; color: #e8c66b; margin: 0 0 0.2em; }
  .sub { color: #8a919c; margin: 0 0 1.5em; }
  nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 0 0 1.5em;
    padding: 0.6em 1em;
    background: #1b1e24;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e36;
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: #8a919c;
  }
  nav a { color: #b9c0ca; text-decoration: none; }
  nav a:hover { color: #e8c66b; }
  nav .date { color: #e8c66b; font-weight: 600; }
  details {
    margin: 0.7em 0;
    background: #1b1e24;
    border: 1px solid #2a2e36;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  details[open] { border-color: #3a4048; }
  summary {
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 0.7em 1em;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6em;
    list-style: none;
  }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::before { content: "▸"; color: #6b727d; transition: transform 0.15s; }
  details[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }
  summary:hover { background: #21252c; }
  summary .name { font-weight: 600; }
  summary .badges { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 0.4em; }
  summary .badge {
    font-size: 0.85em;
    padding: 0.15em 0.7em;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .badge.ok   { background: #1e3524; color: #7fd18a; }
  .badge.warn { background: #3a2f1a; color: #e0b45c; }
  .badge.bad  { background: #3a1f1f; color: #e07b7b; }
  .badge.up   { background: #24322a; color: #9ec9a5; }
  summary .anchor { color: #4a4f58; text-decoration: none; }
  summary .anchor:hover { color: #e8c66b; }
  .tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; }
  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
  th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.45em 1em; }
  th {
    color: #8a919c;
    font-weight: normal;
    font-size: 0.8em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2e36;
  }
  td { border-bottom: 1px solid #22262d; }
  tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  tr:hover td { background: #21252c; }
  tr.locked td:last-child { color: #e07b7b; }
  tr.partial td:last-child { color: #e0b45c; }
  tr.nodata td:last-child { color: #6b727d; }
  .alldone { color: #7fd18a; padding: 0.6em 1em 0.9em; margin: 0; }
  .cheer { color: #7fd18a; }
  .finished { color: #7fd18a; padding: 0.5em 1em 0; margin: 0; }
  .gain { color: #7fd18a; font-size: 0.85em; margin-left: 0.4em; }
  .note { color: #6b727d; font-size: 0.9em; margin-top: 2em; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Omnium Folio, missing progress in mythic L'ura guilds</h1>
<p class="sub"><%= day.missingCount %> of <%= day.total %> checked raiders are not done.<% if (day.finishedCount) { %>
<span class="cheer"><%= day.finishedCount %> finished since <%= day.prevDate %>.</span><% } %>
<%= day.luraOnly ? "Only raiders with a mythic L'ura kill are included." : "Only guilds with a mythic L'ura kill are listed." %></p>
<nav>
  <span><% if (older) { %><a href="<%= older %>.html">&larr; <%= older %></a><% } %></span>
  <span class="date"><%= day.date %></span>
  <span><% if (newer) { %><a href="<%= newer %>.html"><%= newer %> &rarr;</a><% } %></span>
</nav>
<% for (const g of day.guilds) { -%>
<% const id = g.label.toLowerCase().replace(/[^\p{L}0-9]+/gu, '-').replace(/^-|-$/g, '') -%>
<% const badge = g.missing.length === 0 ? 'ok' : g.missing.length * 2 >= g.total ? 'bad' : 'warn' -%>
<details id="<%= id %>">
  <summary>
    <span class="name"><%= g.label %></span>
    <span class="badges">
<% if (g.finished.length) { -%>
      <span class="badge ok">+<%= g.finished.length %> finished</span>
<% } -%>
<% if (g.improved) { -%>
      <span class="badge up"><%= g.improved %> improved</span>
<% } -%>
      <span class="badge <%= badge %>"><%= g.missing.length === 0 ? 'all done' : `${g.missing.length} of ${g.total} behind` %></span>
    </span>
    <a class="anchor" href="#<%= id %>">#</a>
  </summary>
<% if (g.finished.length) { -%>
  <p class="finished">Finished the folio since <%= day.prevDate %>: <%= g.finished.join(', ') %></p>
<% } -%>
<% if (g.missing.length === 0) { -%>
  <p class="alldone">Every raider has the folio finished.</p>
<% } else { -%>
  <div class="tablewrap">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Character</th><th>Realm</th><th>Mythic pulls this tier</th><th>Progress</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
<% for (const r of g.missing) { -%>
      <tr class="<%= r.cls %>"><td><%= r.name %></td><td><%= r.realm %></td><td><%= r.pulls %></td><td><%= r.progress %><% if (r.upFrom != null) { %><span class="gain">up from <%= r.upFrom %>/5</span><% } %></td></tr>
<% } -%>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  </div>
<% } -%>
</details>
<% } -%>
<p class="note">The folio is per character, an alt listed here can still have a finished main.
Raider lists come from Warcraft Logs mythic reports, folio progress from the Blizzard API.</p>
<script>
  var target = location.hash && document.getElementById(location.hash.slice(1))
  if (target && target.tagName === 'DETAILS') { target.open = true; target.scrollIntoView() }
</script>
</body>
</html>
